<title>NETHERLANDS: Not-so-silent Dutch night ends in bloodshed.</title>
<headline>Not-so-silent Dutch night ends in bloodshed.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Dutch woman became so enraged with her husband's carol singing that she grabbed a knife and plunged it into his chest, police said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 55-year-old woman, due to appear in court later on Friday, told police that she put up with her spouse singing &quot;Silent Night&quot; for several hours before stabbing him on Boxing Day.</p>
<p>The husband is recovering in hospital.</p>
